; Regression: `case a,` followed by a line break (the next line starts with its own `case`)
; built an empty EnumCase, reported K0100 at the gap and offered a K0130 fix producing
; `case case b`. A comma with no case name after it is a trailing comma: K0130 at the comma,
; fixed by deleting it.
(SourceFile (EnumDecl enum E (MemberList (EnumCase case a) (EnumCase case b))))
